     "texto": [
      "**Segregować śmieci** means «to separate the waste».",
      "**Papier**, **szkło** and **plastik** are materials that can be separated."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Necessity and prohibition",
     "texto": [
      "**Trzeba + infinitive** expresses necessity; **nie wolno + infinitive** shows that something is forbidden.",
      "In these expressions there is no need to say who carries out the action."
     ],
